msgstr "TLS šifrovanje, uz prijavu na prijavnom ekranu udaljenog računara."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_SecurityRDP)
#: rdp/rdppreferences.ui:1027
#, kde-format
msgid "RDP"
msgstr "RDP"

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_SecurityRDP)
#: rdp/rdppreferences.ui:1030
#, kde-format
msgid "Standard RDP security, the older encryption built into the protocol."
msgstr "Standardna RDP bezbjednost, starije šifrovanje ugrađeno u protokol."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_SecurityEXT)
#: rdp/rdppreferences.ui:1037
#, kde-format
msgid "Ext"
msgstr "Ext"

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_SecurityEXT)
#: rdp/rdppreferences.ui:1040
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Extended Network Level Authentication, which also checks that the account "
"may sign in before the session starts."
msgstr ""
"Proširena autentifikacija na nivou mreže, koja prije početka sesije "
"provjerava i da li nalog smije da se prijavi."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, TlsSecLevelLabel)
#: rdp/rdppreferences.ui:1062
#, kde-format
msgid "TLS security level:"
msgstr "Nivo bezbjednosti TLS‑a:"

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (KComboBox, kcfg_TlsSecLevel)
#: rdp/rdppreferences.ui:1072
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The weakest TLS encryption to accept. A higher level may refuse to connect "
"to older servers."
msgstr ""
"Najslabije TLS šifrovanje koje se prihvata. Viši nivo može da odbije "
"povezivanje sa starijim serverima."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), item, widget (KComboBox, kcfg_TlsSecLevel)
#: rdp/rdppreferences.ui:1082
#, kde-format
msgid "Any"
msgstr "bilo koji"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), item, widget (KComboBox, kcfg_TlsSecLevel)
#: rdp/rdppreferences.ui:1087
#, kde-format
msgid "80 bit"
msgstr "80‑bitni"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), item, widget (KComboBox, kcfg_TlsSecLevel)
#: rdp/rdppreferences.ui:1092
#, kde-format
msgid "112 bit"
msgstr "112‑bitni"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), item, widget (KComboBox, kcfg_TlsSecLevel)
#: rdp/rdppreferences.ui:1097
#, kde-format
msgid "128 bit"
msgstr "128‑bitni"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), item, widget (KComboBox, kcfg_TlsSecLevel)
#: rdp/rdppreferences.ui:1102
#, kde-format
msgid "192 bit"
msgstr "192‑bitni"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), item, widget (KComboBox, kcfg_TlsSecLevel)
#: rdp/rdppreferences.ui:1107
#, kde-format
msgid "256 bit"
msgstr "256‑bitni"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, authPkgListLabel)
#: rdp/rdppreferences.ui:1115
#, kde-format
msgid "Authentication packages:"
msgstr "Paketi za autentifikaciju:"

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QLabel, authPkgListLabel)
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_AuthPkgKerberos)
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_AuthPkgNtlm)
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_AuthPkgU2u)
#: rdp/rdppreferences.ui:1118 rdp/rdppreferences.ui:1130
#: rdp/rdppreferences.ui:1140 rdp/rdppreferences.ui:1150
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Checked packages may be used during CredSSP/NLA negotiation; unchecked "
"packages are explicitly forbidden. For Kerberos-only authentication (e.g. "
"Active Directory Protected Users accounts), uncheck NTLM."
msgstr ""
"Uključeni paketi mogu da se koriste pri pregovaranju CredSSP/NLA; isključeni "
"paketi su izričito zabranjeni. Za autentifikaciju samo preko Kerberosa (npr. "
"nalozi Protected Users u Active Directory), isključite NTLM."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_AuthPkgKerberos)
#: rdp/rdppreferences.ui:1127
#, kde-format
msgid "Kerberos"
msgstr "Kerberos"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_AuthPkgNtlm)
#: rdp/rdppreferences.ui:1137
#, kde-format
msgid "NTLM"
msgstr "NTLM"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_AuthPkgU2u)
#: rdp/rdppreferences.ui:1147
#, kde-format
msgid "U2U"
msgstr "U2U"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_UseDefaultKerberosRealm)
#: rdp/rdppreferences.ui:1172
#, kde-format
msgid "Use the default Kerberos realm for unmapped domains"
msgstr "Koristi podrazumijevano carstvo Kerberosa za nemapirane domene"

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_UseDefaultKerberosRealm)
#: rdp/rdppreferences.ui:1175
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Enable this for an alternate sign-in suffix that uses the default realm in "
"your Kerberos configuration. The desktop and gateway login names may be sent "
"to that realm. Leave this unchecked if the default realm is unrelated to "
"this connection."
msgstr ""
"Uključite ovo za drugi sufiks prijave koji koristi podrazumijevano carstvo "
"iz vaše postave Kerberosa. Prijavna imena za površ i mrežni izlaz mogu biti "
"poslata tom carstvu. Ostavite ovo isključeno ako se podrazumijevano carstvo "
"ne odnosi na ovu vezu."

#: rdp/rdpsession.cpp:1404
#, kde-format
